Package: wanglinux-base
Version: 1.0.2-1~aurora3
Architecture: all
Maintainer: WangLinux Project <dev@wanglinux.example>
Installed-Size: 96
Depends: bash (>= 5.0), dpkg, coreutils, sed, grep
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/wanglinux/wanglinux
Description: WangLinux identity, release metadata and admin commands
 Ships the WangLinux release identity (/etc/os-release, /etc/wanglinux/release),
 the wanginfo / help-wang / wanglinux-version commands and the login motd.
 .
 The release files are installed through dpkg-divert so that Debian's
 base-files keeps ownership of the original paths and any upgrade or
 removal cleanly restores them.
